Wurm Unlimited Mods and Tools by Axeblade
Copyright (c) 2026 Axeblade (axeblade346). All rights reserved.

This repository holds the source code of the following projects, together called "the Software":
WU-Upscaler, WOM-Converter, WOM-Viewer, CodeNames and UserPacks.

1. Using the release files
   You may download the release files from this repository's Releases page and use them,
   unchanged, for your own use with Wurm Unlimited: in single player, on your own server, or on
   servers whose rules allow them.

2. Everything else needs written permission first
   Unless the author has given you permission in writing, you may not:
   - copy, change, translate or adapt the source code, in whole or in part;
   - use the source code, or parts of it, in other mods, tools or projects;
   - publish, re-upload, redistribute, sublicense or sell the Software or its release files.
     Please link to this repository instead.
   Viewing this repository and forking it on GitHub, as GitHub's Terms of Service allow, gives no
   other rights.

3. Asking for permission
   Contact Axeblade:
   - axeblade346 on the Sklotopolis forums
   - axeblade on the Wurm modding Discord
   - an issue on this repository

4. Parts made by others
   These parts are not covered by the copyright above and keep their own licences:
   - realesr-general-x4v3.npz and realesr-general-wdn-x4v3.npz (WU-Upscaler, WOM-Converter):
     model weights from Real-ESRGAN, Copyright (c) 2021 Xintao Wang, BSD 3-Clause licence,
     see REALESRGAN_LICENSE.txt in those folders.
   - realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan (the GPU engine): not included. The tools download it from the
     Real-ESRGAN GitHub releases (https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN) only when you ask them to.
     Copyright (c) 2021 Xintao Wang; it keeps its own licence.
   - three.js and OrbitControls, built into wom_viewer.html (WOM-Viewer, WOM-Converter):
     Copyright (c) 2010-2026 three.js authors, MIT licence, see THREEJS_LICENSE.txt.
   - Ago's client mod loader and javassist: not included; needed to run CodeNames and UserPacks.

5. Credits
   - WOM-Converter and WOM-Viewer build on BDEW's update of the original Code Club AB .wom
     converter (https://github.com/bdew-wurm/WOM-Converter), used with BDEW's permission.
   - The WOM-Viewer interface is modelled on Warlander's WOM Model Viewer and DeedPlanner 3.

6. Wurm Unlimited
   Wurm Unlimited and its game files are owned by Code Club AB. This project is not made by or
   affiliated with Code Club AB. The tools only work with game files you already have; anything
   they make from those files (for example upscaled texture packs) contains Code Club AB's art and
   is for your own use.

7. No warranty
   The Software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. In no event
   shall the author be liable for any claim, damages or other liability arising from the use of the
   Software. Keep backups of your game folder and your own files.
